OL,3,ABank of England about to announce
OL,4,Ainterest rate decision, after first
OL,5,Araise in US for three years
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Bank of England is about to
OL,8,Fannounce its latest decision on
OL,9,Finterest rates - stay with us for live
OL,10,Fupdates
OL,12,FMost economists expect the Bank's
OL,13,FMonetary Policy Committee to hold the
OL,14,Frate at 3.75% for a sixth consecutive
OL,15,Fmeeting
OL,17,FAt its last meeting in July, three of
OL,18,Fthe committee's nine members voted for
OL,19,Fan increase to 4%
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
