OL,3,ABank of England about to announce
OL,4,Ainterest rate decision, after first
OL,5,Araise in US for three years
OL,6,
OL,7,FIncreasing interest rates can help slow
OL,8,Fdown the rate of inflation, as it can
OL,9,Fmake borrowing (including mortgages)
OL,10,Fmore expensive
OL,12,FUK inflation is currently at 3.1% -
OL,13,Fabove the Bank's 2% target - partly due
OL,14,Fto increasing petrol and diesel prices,
OL,15,Fdriven by the Iran war
OL,17,FThe Bank's decision will come after the
OL,18,FUS Federal Reserve increased interest
OL,19,Frates for the first time in more than
OL,20,Fthree years
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
